## 1. Project Architecture & Tech Stack (STRICT)

### ERP System (`C:\ERP_3152026\`)
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite (TypeScript), Tailwind CSS v4, Lucide Icons, Zustand
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express (CommonJS — `"type":"module"` is NOT set here), raw SQL via `pg` pool
- **DB**: PostgreSQL — `metapharsic_erp`, user: `erp_user`, password: `Metapharsic@ERP2026!`, host: `localhost`
- **API Client**: `src/services/apiClient.ts` (Auto-injects JWT Bearer token)
- **Auth**: JWT — `server/utils/jwt.js` exports `verifyTokenMiddleware`, `verifyRoleMiddleware`, `verify2FAMiddleware`
- **AI**: Google Gemini `gemini-1.5-flash` — always provide heuristic fallback when `GEMINI_API_KEY` is unset

### MR Tracker (`/u01/apps/Metapharsic_MrTracker/`)
- **Frontend**: React + Vite (TypeScript), Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion (`motion/react`), Lucide Icons
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express (ESM — `"type":"module"` IS set), TypeScript compiled
- **DB**: PostgreSQL — `metaphysic_crm`, user: `metaphysic_user`, password: `Metapharsic2026!Secure`, host: `localhost`
- **DB module**: `src/database/db.ts` — exports `testConnection`, `query`, `repositories`
- **Fallback**: In-memory `data` object when DB is unavailable (`dbReady === false`)
- **Auth**: `x-user-email` header resolved to user from DB/memory; role-based access
- **AI**: Google Gemini API (`@google/genai`) — Gemini service in `src/services/geminiService.ts`

### CRITICAL: In-Memory vs DB Mode
The MR Tracker has two execution paths:
- **DB path** (`dbReady && db`): Queries `metaphysic_crm` PostgreSQL via `db.repositories.*`
- **In-memory path** (fallback): Uses `const data = { mrs, doctors, pharmacies, hospitals, visit_schedules, ... }`
- **Seed dates are evaluated at SERVER START TIME** — never compute "today/yesterday/lastWeek" in IIFE seed objects. Always compute relative dates at REQUEST TIME inside the endpoint handler.

