## 6. Complete Testing Blueprint (MANDATORY — ALL 4 TIERS)

Every functional block must have tests across ALL four tiers.

### Tier 1: Unit & Service Tests
- **Location**: `src/services/__tests__/` or `server/__tests__/`
- **Objective**: Pure calculations, utility functions, data transformations — NO DB/network
- **Must test**: Date helper functions, territory matching, conversion rate formula, profitability calc
- **Run**: `npx vitest run src/services/__tests__/someTest.test.ts`

### Tier 2: Integration Tests (Backend API)
- **Location**: `server/__tests__/` (ERP) or `src/database/__tests__/` (MR Tracker)
- **Objective**: Full HTTP → Express → DB → response cycle
- **Pattern**: Mock JWT middleware via require cache injection; use `afterAll` cleanup
- **Must test**: `/api/monthly-metrics`, `/api/pcd/mrs`, `/api/pcd/mrs/stats`, profitability endpoint
- **Run**: `npx vitest run server/__tests__/someIntegration.test.js`

### Tier 3: Component (UI) Tests
- **Location**: `src/components/__tests__/`
- **Objective**: React renders, state transitions, widget visibility, loading/error states
- **Pattern**: `vi.mock` all services inline (no top-level variable references), `waitFor` for async
- **Must test**: All metric cards show correct values, widget toggle hides/shows sections, task CRUD
- **Run**: `npx vitest run src/components/__tests__/someUI.test.tsx`

### Tier 4: End-to-End (E2E) Tests
- **Location**: `e2e/`
- **Objective**: Full browser automation — login → navigate → assert real data
- **Pattern**: Playwright with `page.request` for API assertions alongside visual assertions
- **Must test**: Dashboard loads non-zero metrics, visit scheduling flow, MR filter/sort, profitability panel
- **Run**: `npx playwright test`

