## 11. Settings Architecture Rules

Settings are persisted in `erp_settings` table (key/value). Use **hybrid API-first + localStorage cache**:

```
Mount  → (1) Render from localStorage cache (no flicker)
         (2) Refresh from API → overwrite cache + state
Save   → (1) PUT to API (authoritative DB)
         (2) On success: update localStorage
         (3) Dispatch: window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('erp:settings:<key>', { detail }))
```

Cross-module listeners: POS, Inventory, Accounts, Auth/Session.

