## 16. Cross-App Sync Protocol (ERP ↔ MR Tracker)

### Data Ownership
| Entity | Authoritative Source | Read-Only Mirror |
|---|---|---|
| MR master data | ERP `medical_representatives` | MR Tracker `mrs` table |
| Visit schedules | MR Tracker `visit_schedules` | ERP dashboard widget |
| PCD transactions | ERP `pcd_transactions` | MR Tracker `sales` |
| Product catalog | ERP `products` + `batches` | MR Tracker `products` |

### Sync Rules
- ERP Dashboard `/api/pcd/mrs` → computes `total_sales` + `target_achievement` from `pcd_transactions`
- ERP Dashboard MUST NOT call `/api/hr/performance` for MR stats — use `/api/pcd/mrs/stats`
- MR Tracker visit data flows to ERP via: MR Tracker API → webhook → ERP `/api/pcd/activity_sync`
- Daily sync cron (midnight): ERP PCD targets → MR Tracker `targets` table

### ERP Dashboard Widget for MR Performance
- Source: `GET /api/pcd/mrs` (with computed `total_sales` from `pcd_transactions`)
- Stats: `GET /api/pcd/mrs/stats` (NOT `/api/hr/performance`)
- Field Force chart: `employees` state from `medical_representatives` — `salesTarget` and `totalSales` must be non-zero
- All widgets guarded by `visibleWidgets.*` — Hide All must actually hide all sections

